  },
  {
   "id": "IqkRXn-SJWRwXUnw5Lsph",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 540.2367999999998,
   "y": 1695,
   "width": 679.5264000000004,
   "height": 210,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "b08",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 371655630,
   "version": 3,
   "versionNonce": 1388224082,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1791141138055,
   "created": 1791141138055,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A. In the devops repo  (CHOSEN)\nshared chart for every app = HOW apps run\ndevelopers never learn Helm\n\nB. In each app repo: when an app needs its own special chart\nC. Published as OCI chart (ghcr.io/.../charts/app:1.0.1),\nconfig repo pins the version: many teams",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "UtlAAdP-xuRwIfpwHOczv",
   "originalText": "A. In the devops repo  (CHOSEN)\nshared chart for every app = HOW apps run\ndevelopers never learn Helm\n\nB. In each app repo: when an app needs its own special chart\nC. Published as OCI chart (ghcr.io/.../charts/app:1.0.1),\nconfig repo pins the version: many teams",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
  {
   "id": "tsb5CSGCAurCFFjxALEsB",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2337.0887999999995,
   "y": 1710,
   "width": 605.8224000000004,
   "height": 180,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "b09",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 577853966,
   "version": 3,
   "versionNonce": 884910030,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1791141138055,
   "created": 1791141138055,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "With two real repos, only 3 things change\n\n1. app CI writes to the config repo with a deploy key\n   (write access to that one repo only)\n2. CODEOWNERS becomes repo permissions per team\n3. app CI checks out the config repo for the e2e test",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "b9QccYGQMjRyq_ChfqaIs",
   "originalText": "With two real repos, only 3 things change\n\n1. app CI writes to the config repo with a deploy key\n   (write access to that one repo only)\n2. CODEOWNERS becomes repo permissions per team\n3. app CI checks out the config repo for the e2e test",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
  {
   "id": "M2s6IncBkx1X02JsCyD9r",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 4021.14,
   "y": 1737.5,
   "width": 737.7199999999999,
   "height": 125,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "b0A",
